## ⭐️ Sample 1‑Day Itinerary (≈ 8 hours)

| Time | Activity | Location |
|------|----------|----------|
| 08:30‑09:30 | Breakfast & check‑out (if you’re leaving the hotel) | Hotel Vista Atsugi |
| 09:45‑11:30 | **Atsugi City Museum** – interactive local history | 1‑10‑1 Shōnan‑chō |
| 11:45‑12:45 | Light lunch at **Sōji‑ji Temple’s tea‑house** (matcha set) | Sōji‑ji |
| 13:00‑14:30 | **Mount Ōyama Ropeway & short hike** – great views | Ōyama‑san Ropeway |
| 15:00‑16:30 | **Sagamihara Green Center** – flower garden & butterfly house | Midori‑chō |
| 17:00‑18:30 | Dinner at **Odawara Fish Market** – fresh sushi | Minato‑dōri |
| 19:00‑20:30 | Evening stroll & night‑lights at **Odawara Castle** | Ōkubo‑chō |

*Feel free to swap any stop with a nearby attraction that better matches your interests (e.g., replace the hike with a visit to **Yamato‑Daishi Temple** if you prefer cultural sites).*

