## 🚍 Getting Around

| Transport | Typical Frequency / Travel Time | Tips |
|-----------|--------------------------------|------|
| **JR Yokohama Line** (Atsugi ↔ Sagamihara ↔ Odawara) | Every 10‑15 min; 15‑30 min between stations | Best for inter‑city hops. |
| **Kanagawa‑Chūō Bus** (routes 7, 10, 12, 23, etc.) | Every 10‑20 min; stops near most attractions | English signage on most buses; front‑board displays the route number. |
| **Taxi / Ride‑share** | 5‑15 min for nearby spots; ~30 min to Odawara | Handy for mountain‑trail access (Ōyama, Takatori). |
| **Car rental** | Recommended for Lake Tanzawa, Mount Takatori, or multi‑day trips. | Free parking at most trailheads; GPS works well in the area. |

